1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:04,120
You'll join the training camp in
late February after the New Year.

2
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:05,440
The assessment is in early June.

3
00:00:05,679 --> 00:00:07,160
Enrollment in early July.

4
00:00:09,519 --> 00:00:11,880
You sound like I'm guaranteed
to pass the assessment.

5
00:00:12,599 --> 00:00:15,279
Doesn't my son have what it takes?

6
00:00:16,120 --> 00:00:17,120
Thanks, Old Xu.

7
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:26,000
They broke up a long time ago.

8
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,280
What about these two?

9
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:28,735
[Changyang's evil little sister is
on the phone with a fortune teller]

10
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:29,760
They're together.

11
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,159
Pick two more numbers between 1 and 45.

12
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:33,920
Hmm.

13
00:00:34,079 --> 00:00:35,920
23 and 27.

14
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:41,719
The two people you just
thought of are twin flames.

15
00:00:42,320 --> 00:00:43,359
What does that mean?

16
00:00:44,399 --> 00:00:45,399
Look it up yourself.

17
00:00:45,479 --> 00:00:46,919
The two of them came from a certain

18
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:49,079
place with a mission to be here.

19
00:00:49,159 --> 00:00:51,319
So their meeting was inevitable,

20
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,320
not a coincidence.

21
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:53,280
Ah, I won't say anymore.

22
00:00:53,281 --> 00:00:54,921
I can't reveal too many heavenly secrets.

23
00:00:55,359 --> 00:00:58,600
Then how can I make them break up?

24
00:00:58,759 --> 00:01:00,559
And get him back
together with the other guy?

25
00:01:01,399 --> 00:01:03,560
Keep the three of them in your mind,

26
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:06,920
and pick three more numbers from 1 to 45.

27
00:01:08,120 --> 00:01:09,120
2.

28
00:01:09,519 --> 00:01:12,920
Hmm, 35, and 7.

29
00:01:14,079 --> 00:01:17,560
Well, looking at the current
situation, it's not hard.

30
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,399
You can temporarily get you what you want.

31
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,919
But no matter what you do,

32
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:23,719
it won't change the final outcome.

33
00:01:23,786 --> 00:01:26,206
[Robo-narration explaining true love and fate
playing in the backround for some reason]

34
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:28,000
That's fine, just tell me what to do.

35
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:30,879
Just use your current identities.

36
00:01:30,959 --> 00:01:32,920
Your dual identity in reality and online.

37
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:35,096
But there's one thing you
need to be careful about.

38
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,999
Look at this Persona card.

39
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:38,920
They can't be completely exposed.

40
00:01:39,286 --> 00:01:41,486
Otherwise, you'll be doomed as well.

41
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:45,484
[The most important goal is unity, not only in
terms of emotions or lifestyle,

42
00:01:45,508 --> 00:01:47,124
but also in a harmonious
and positive collaboration

43
00:01:47,149 --> 00:01:50,152
to achieve a higher level
of universal love together.]

44
00:01:50,793 --> 00:01:51,939
"A Winter Sun Wakes the Wind in Spring Hills' Dream"

45
00:01:51,963 --> 00:01:54,445
[People encounter different
soulmates at different stages of life,

46
00:01:54,492 --> 00:01:56,839
but each soul will only
have one twin flame.]

47
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:06,200
(Episode 10: Filling the tower)

48
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,520
Brother.

49
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:17,599
When are you bringing
my sister-in-law back again?

50
00:02:17,879 --> 00:02:19,079
Last time you came home for dinner,

51
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,199
didn't you hide?

52
00:02:20,319 --> 00:02:23,319
That was my first time meeting
him, I was just too nervous!

53
00:02:23,599 --> 00:02:24,599
Oh, come on, brother.

54
00:02:24,879 --> 00:02:26,519
I promise if you bring him back again,

55
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,599
I definitely won't hide.

56
00:02:28,199 --> 00:02:29,199
We'll see.

57
00:02:44,159 --> 00:02:48,879
["From Today The Sun Sets At
The South Tower" begins shooting]

58
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,120
Pick one.

59
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,319
Hand me that sleep mask.

60
00:03:43,993 --> 00:03:45,273
I'll hold it down, you read it.

61
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:48,656
The wind and rain darken the sky,

62
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,880
The roosters crow without end.

63
00:03:50,080 --> 00:03:51,240
Now that I have seen my lord,

64
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,479
How could I not be overjoyed?

65
00:03:53,199 --> 00:03:54,919
You can do one more line.

66
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:57,520
Are you collecting my voice?

67
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,319
For my navigation.

68
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,919
Did you see your lord today?

69
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:05,360
Can you put some emotion into it?

70
00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:09,199
Did you see your lord today?

71
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,800
Pretty good.

72
00:04:12,879 --> 00:04:13,879
Pretty good.

73
00:04:14,319 --> 00:04:15,960
I mean, it's pretty good.

74
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:19,000
I mean, it's pretty good.

75
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,319
I can't see!

76
00:04:26,360 --> 00:04:27,360
I'm going to fall!

77
00:04:27,399 --> 00:04:28,399
Ah!

78
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:33,879
When are you going to the
training camp after the New Year?

79
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:35,319
Late February.

80
00:04:36,079 --> 00:04:37,079
For three months?

81
00:04:37,959 --> 00:04:38,959
Yeah.

82
00:04:39,680 --> 00:04:41,280
Once youI pass the assessment, you'll enroll.

83
00:04:42,279 --> 00:04:43,279
Yeah.

84
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,760
Getting answers out of
you is like pulling teeth.

85
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:49,879
Reporting to the boss.

86
00:04:49,959 --> 00:04:50,999
Training camp from March to June.

87
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,079
Enrollment in late July.

88
00:04:58,800 --> 00:05:00,000
Are you sure you'll pass?

89
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,279
Doesn't your husband have what it takes?

90
00:05:05,560 --> 00:05:06,560
Get lost.

91
00:05:07,330 --> 00:05:07,976
Don't move.

92
00:05:09,609 --> 00:05:11,523
[Feng Lizhen is calling]

93
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,879
My mom is calling me.

94
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,679
Hi, brother, sister-in-law, Happy New Year!

95
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,720
Why is it you?

96
00:05:24,920 --> 00:05:26,160
Where are you guys right now?

97
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:28,279
Manyin Village. What about you?

98
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,560
We just arrived in Nanlu.

99
00:05:30,759 --> 00:05:32,855
Why don't you two come over
and ring in the New Year with us?

100
00:05:32,879 --> 00:05:34,919
No way. Your
sister-in-law is a firecracker.

101
00:05:34,920 --> 00:05:36,160
She blows up wherever she goes.

102
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,480
Fine.

103
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,879
Hey, hello, Xiaoxiao.

104
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,560
Sister-in-law! Sister-in-law!
Happy New Year, sister-in-law!

105
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:46,399
I'm bowing to wish you a Happy
New Year. One bow, two bows...

106
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,120
Stop.
Three bows...

107
00:05:48,199 --> 00:05:49,600
You're definitely up to no good.

108
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,519
Just take good care of the two elders.

109
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:54,319
Yes, sir! Mission guaranteed
to be accomplished!

110
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,720
Hanging up.

111
00:06:00,279 --> 00:06:01,279
Ah.

112
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,696
That new show your company is producing,

113
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,920
aren't you going to act in it?

114
00:06:23,399 --> 00:06:24,399
I can't.

115
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:26,680
A cameo in the spin-off is one thing,

116
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:29,160
but my character has a
romance arc in the main series.

117
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,480
With a guy or a girl?

118
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:33,560
Same as you.

119
00:06:35,153 --> 00:06:37,192
Because of me, you don't take romance roles anymore?

120
00:06:37,879 --> 00:06:39,439
I won't take them while we're together.

121
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:42,320
Can't you just say you'll never
take them for the rest of your life?

122
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:45,399
Fine.

123
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:13,480
Senior Brother.

124
00:07:15,720 --> 00:07:17,000
Let us part.

125
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:26,519
And after we part?

126
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,120
We go our separate ways and live well.

127
00:08:14,319 --> 00:08:15,319
Cut!

128
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:16,160
Awesome, awesome!

129
00:08:16,161 --> 00:08:17,720
That scene was incredible!

130
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:21,519
What was that singing
in the valley just now?

131
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:24,576
A poem written to the God
of Death by the Manyin people.

132
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,958
It's chanted by the
high priest of the village.

133
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:29,239
They chant it every New
Year's Eve to pray for blessings.

134
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:31,759
Praying to the God of Death?

135
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:34,399
They believe that death is life.

136
00:08:34,519 --> 00:08:36,279
Without death, there is no new life.

137
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:38,599
Hey, two of you, head over there.

138
00:08:38,600 --> 00:08:41,158
Can we ask the priest to
record this chant for us?

139
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:41,720
Come on.
Sure.

140
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,519
I want to go see Sister Lan.

141
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,200
Do you really want to?

142
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,279
Seeing that cloud

143
00:08:54,919 --> 00:08:56,480
suddenly reminded me of her.

144
00:09:36,200 --> 00:09:37,720
I shouldn't have said anything.

145
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,800
There's no such thing as
a straight path to the end.

146
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:19,519
I thought going to Camellia
Village would be on the way to Xigui.

147
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:22,919
People always fail because
of their own assumptions.

148
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,480
Excuse me, ma'am!
We want to get out of this mountain road.

149
00:10:45,481 --> 00:10:46,759
How do we get to the highway?

150
00:10:46,799 --> 00:10:47,720
Go straight ahead.

151
00:10:47,721 --> 00:10:49,921
There's a Tea God Temple
there with a fork in the road.

152
00:10:50,720 --> 00:10:51,720
Okay, thank you, ma'am.
You're welcome.

153
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:46,799
Excuse me, sir, how do we
get to the Tea God Temple?

154
00:11:46,879 --> 00:11:47,879
Go this way.

155
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,519
We just passed the Tea God Temple.

156
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,558
You couldn't tell from the outside wall.

157
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:58,720
We both missed it.

158
00:11:59,320 --> 00:12:00,320
What are they singing?

159
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:04,135
A poem written to the God
of Death by the Manyin people.

160
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:06,079
It's chanted by the
high priest of the village.

161
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,120
Every New Year's Day,

162
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,719
they chant it to pray for blessings.

163
00:12:08,919 --> 00:12:10,080
Praying to the God of Death?

164
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:12,278
They believe that death is life.

165
00:12:12,279 --> 00:12:13,799
Without death, there is no new life.

166
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:16,279
A very simple sense of reverence.

167
00:12:37,519 --> 00:12:39,159
Happy New Year, Sister.

168
00:12:40,759 --> 00:12:42,320
Happy New Year, Sister Jialin.

169
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,600
Look at the trending topics.

170
00:12:47,919 --> 00:12:49,062
(Your sister-in-law is a firecracker.
She blows up wherever she goes.)

171
00:12:49,086 --> 00:12:50,175
["Feng Qinglang's suspected boyfriend"
+ a recording evil little sister made]

172
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,159
Is this your sister?
Yes.

173
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:53,919
At least she knew to cover your face.

174
00:12:54,399 --> 00:12:55,759
You two need to be careful.

175
00:12:56,600 --> 00:13:00,279
This video was posted by
someone named Wajijilu.

176
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:01,759
I had someone look into it.

177
00:13:01,879 --> 00:13:04,080
They're a veteran shipper
of Hao Qing Wan Zhong.

178
00:13:04,360 --> 00:13:07,026
If it is your sister, you'll
have to look that up yourself.

179
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,799
I'll suppress this trending topic for now.

180
00:13:09,159 --> 00:13:10,320
Is it Xiaoxiao?

181
00:13:12,679 --> 00:13:13,878
She also posted something else.

182
00:13:13,879 --> 00:13:16,399
It's a photo from when I brought
you home for dinner last time.

183
00:13:31,399 --> 00:13:35,359
Hello, the number you
dialed is not answering.

184
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:37,360
Please try again later.

185
00:13:51,919 --> 00:13:53,600
If the original video leaks,

186
00:13:55,080 --> 00:13:57,480
will your enrollment
qualification be revoked?

187
00:13:58,399 --> 00:13:59,535
I haven't even taken the assessment yet.

188
00:13:59,559 --> 00:14:00,919
What enrollment qualification?

189
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:20,080
Sister Lan, you once told
me to be brave in love,

190
00:14:20,519 --> 00:14:22,919
but also to take
responsibility for my actions.

191
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:27,200
Does that mean love isn't
about ignoring the consequences?

192
00:14:28,759 --> 00:14:30,719
If love requires calculating
the consequences,

193
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,000
it's no longer pure.

194
00:14:32,519 --> 00:14:35,000
Is it still love if it's not pure?

195
00:14:36,153 --> 00:14:37,913
Xu Luxiao, you must be sick in the head.

196
00:14:38,159 --> 00:14:39,480
You're the one who's sick!

197
00:14:39,919 --> 00:14:41,976
You purposely made a video
call to record it, didn't you?

198
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,278
I'll do whatever I want.

199
00:14:43,279 --> 00:14:44,758
Give Hao Qing Wan Zhong back to me!

200
00:14:44,759 --> 00:14:45,999
You're a freaking college student now!

201
00:14:46,023 --> 00:14:47,343
Don't you have any brains at all?

202
00:14:47,367 --> 00:14:49,846
[He's deleting a message from Secretary Li
stating the original video has been removed]

203
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,495
We're not going to Camellia Village.

204
00:14:52,519 --> 00:14:53,519
We're going home.

205
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,720
Okay.

206
00:15:10,600 --> 00:15:12,280
I just can't get into character, Director.

207
00:15:13,080 --> 00:15:14,879
Well, try looking at it from another angle.

208
00:15:15,399 --> 00:15:18,240
If your lover kept something from you,

209
00:15:18,559 --> 00:15:20,519
and you eventually found
out you were being used,

210
00:15:20,759 --> 00:15:22,879
while they kept insisting
it was for your own good.

211
00:15:25,039 --> 00:15:26,799
Come on, Haoyu, give us a look of betrayal.

212
00:15:27,159 --> 00:15:28,159
Ah.

213
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:32,359
Yeah, feel it the way I described.

214
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:33,640
We'll try another take in a bit.

215
00:15:33,879 --> 00:15:36,480
If it really doesn't
work, we'll shoot it last.

216
00:15:37,159 --> 00:15:38,159
Thanks, Director.

217
00:16:09,639 --> 00:16:11,620
Lu, your portrayal of Nanlou is too bitter.

218
00:16:11,644 --> 00:16:12,210
[Conversation with Tian Guoguo]

219
00:16:12,279 --> 00:16:14,239
The other day when you
two shot the valley scene,

220
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:16,039
I could tell you caught real feelings.

221
00:16:16,440 --> 00:16:18,899
Brother Guo is warning you,
don't get in too deep.

222
00:16:18,937 --> 00:16:19,339
[Risk agreement]

223
00:16:19,453 --> 00:16:20,879
Qi Haoyu is bad news.

224
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,735
You know perfectly well he's using you.

225
00:16:22,759 --> 00:16:24,200
He's playing you like a tool.

226
00:16:24,399 --> 00:16:25,399
Don't take it seriously.

227
00:16:25,600 --> 00:16:27,000
Just have fun and leave it at that.

228
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,480
Coming.

229
00:16:42,679 --> 00:16:44,200
Then you might as well kill me too!

230
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:45,960
I still have me!

231
00:16:46,639 --> 00:16:48,359
I've known everything from start to finish.

232
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,639
I know the most!

233
00:16:50,279 --> 00:16:52,080
Nanlou, Nanlou, calm down!

234
00:16:52,799 --> 00:16:54,600
Everything I did was for you!

235
00:17:17,759 --> 00:17:18,559
Cut!
Good.

236
00:17:19,079 --> 00:17:19,880
Playback.

237
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Okay.

238
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,359
That's a wrap!

239
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,520
That's a wrap for this scene!

240
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:55,480
Great work, everyone.

241
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:24,640
Bro, let me borrow your phone.

242
00:18:24,960 --> 00:18:26,599
Why? Want to see the behind-the-scenes?

243
00:18:26,839 --> 00:18:28,999
I saw you recording the
playback earlier. Let me see.

244
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:30,000
Here.

245
00:18:30,839 --> 00:18:31,839
Guo!

246
00:18:31,880 --> 00:18:33,200
Coming, Brother Long!

247
00:18:39,039 --> 00:18:40,079
It's not hot, here.

248
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:42,078
Not bad acting.

249
00:18:42,079 --> 00:18:43,079
Right?

250
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:45,759
Really.
That's what I'm saying.

251
00:18:46,640 --> 00:18:47,079
Ah.
Come find me for your next project.

252
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:48,839
I'll definitely find you.
I'll definitely find you for the next one.

253
00:18:49,622 --> 00:18:50,622
Let me tell you...

254
00:19:06,599 --> 00:19:09,000
You're going to the training
camp right when I'm away.

255
00:19:10,279 --> 00:19:12,079
Even if I were there,
you wouldn't dare come.

256
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:13,680
Who wouldn't dare?

257
00:19:15,160 --> 00:19:16,559
A good brother seeing you off.

258
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:19,240
Who's your good brother?

259
00:19:21,240 --> 00:19:22,240
Fine.

260
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,559
Then I'll wear women's clothes.

261
00:19:24,880 --> 00:19:26,440
I'll cross-dress to see you off.

262
00:19:33,160 --> 00:19:34,640
No days off for three months?

263
00:19:36,079 --> 00:19:37,079
I don't know.

264
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:51,440
Come down.

265
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:53,240
Come up.

266
00:20:07,839 --> 00:20:09,000
I just found my bag.

267
00:20:09,359 --> 00:20:10,759
Don't lose yourself.

268
00:20:24,359 --> 00:20:25,359
What's wrong?

269
00:20:25,680 --> 00:20:28,200
I want to stay in character for
the scenes these next few days.

270
00:20:28,680 --> 00:20:30,799
Man, acting like this will
give you schizophrenia.

271
00:21:22,599 --> 00:21:23,799
Why are you here?

272
00:21:25,279 --> 00:21:26,719
Your father needed me for something.

273
00:21:28,599 --> 00:21:29,759
I'll wait for you downstairs.

274
00:21:35,285 --> 00:21:37,486
This is our third time meeting.

275
00:21:39,026 --> 00:21:40,586
[Changyang's submission form]

276
00:21:45,359 --> 00:21:47,039
The higher-ups received a report letter.

277
00:21:47,960 --> 00:21:52,440
Citing Changyang's orientation, they
revoked his training camp qualification.

278
00:21:55,240 --> 00:21:56,839
Wasn't the original video deleted?

279
00:21:59,160 --> 00:22:02,000
Not everything relies on the truth.

280
00:22:02,599 --> 00:22:06,400
If someone reports it, someone
else will want to avoid the trouble.

281
00:22:09,960 --> 00:22:11,599
Is there any room to salvage this?

282
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:16,240
I'll try to fight for him again.

283
00:22:16,839 --> 00:22:18,079
But time and time again,

284
00:22:19,599 --> 00:22:21,799
there won't be a third chance.

285
00:22:32,240 --> 00:22:33,400
I understand.

286
00:22:35,266 --> 00:22:37,105
I'll draw a clear line with him.

287
00:22:47,960 --> 00:22:48,960
Uncle.

288
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:52,759
You win.

289
00:23:02,079 --> 00:23:04,079
Qingtian wants to participate
in that documentary.

290
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,160
Are you going to support your brother?

291
00:23:10,839 --> 00:23:12,599
Use your phone to call Xu Luxiao.

292
00:23:12,759 --> 00:23:13,759
What's wrong?

293
00:23:15,960 --> 00:23:17,440
I've acted with you so many times,

294
00:23:17,799 --> 00:23:19,160
now act with me for once.

295
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:44,160
Are you at home?

296
00:23:45,240 --> 00:23:48,200
Can you get a shot of downstairs at
Wenshu's place from your second floor?

297
00:23:48,799 --> 00:23:50,880
Take the photos and wait for my word.

298
00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:53,599
If you want to see the
Hao-Qing ship make a comeback,

299
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:55,680
don't post the photos online.

300
00:24:26,079 --> 00:24:30,359
This is great!

301
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:36,039
My ship is coming back to life, oh my god!

302
00:25:01,359 --> 00:25:03,159
Xu Luxiao, what rumors
are you spreading now?

303
00:25:03,200 --> 00:25:04,558
I'm just shipping my couple.

304
00:25:04,559 --> 00:25:05,856
How is that any of your business?

305
00:25:05,880 --> 00:25:06,880
It is.

306
00:25:09,880 --> 00:25:11,598
You sank my ship.

307
00:25:11,599 --> 00:25:12,960
We are sworn enemies.

308
00:25:13,400 --> 00:25:14,240
Are you crazy?
If you spread rumors again,

309
00:25:14,839 --> 00:25:15,759
I'll report your account.

310
00:25:15,839 --> 00:25:16,839
You...!

311
00:25:23,039 --> 00:25:24,480
Just you wait!

312
00:25:26,386 --> 00:25:27,706
[Shi Yuhao calling]

313
00:25:46,599 --> 00:25:49,319
You know Changyang's training
camp qualification got revoked, right?

314
00:25:51,240 --> 00:25:52,240
You did this?

315
00:25:52,799 --> 00:25:54,599
I've always thought you owed me.

316
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,240
Bullshit.

317
00:25:57,759 --> 00:25:58,879
When you sank the ship back then,

318
00:25:58,880 --> 00:26:00,800
you and Sister Lan
weren't exactly sitting idle.

319
00:26:01,559 --> 00:26:03,159
You were the one who played dirty first.

320
00:26:04,079 --> 00:26:05,000
It's like boxing.

321
00:26:05,001 --> 00:26:07,599
It takes a punch from you and a
punch from me to make a fight.

322
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:10,160
Well, I still have some good stuff on hand.

323
00:26:10,440 --> 00:26:11,758
I asked you out before
and you didn't believe me.

324
00:26:11,759 --> 00:26:13,519
Like I was making
things up out of thin air.

325
00:26:13,759 --> 00:26:14,880
Now you know.

326
00:26:16,599 --> 00:26:17,775
I'll send you another picture.

327
00:26:17,799 --> 00:26:19,599
Think again about
whether you want to see me.

328
00:26:19,919 --> 00:26:22,359
[Shi Yuhao sending a screenshot
of a conversation with Wajijilu]

329
00:26:22,419 --> 00:26:25,713
[My brother brought Lang Di back home, are
things really done between the two of you?]

330
00:26:25,738 --> 00:26:27,866
[I can help you get him back]

331
00:26:33,519 --> 00:26:35,640
Set the time and place and send them to me.

332
00:26:36,680 --> 00:26:37,680
You notify the paparazzi.

333
00:27:17,640 --> 00:27:18,640
Your acting's pretty good.

334
00:27:19,906 --> 00:27:21,426
I didn't win Best Actor for nothing.

335
00:27:21,880 --> 00:27:23,640
Bring out the evidence you have.

336
00:27:24,359 --> 00:27:25,359
And your terms?

337
00:27:26,359 --> 00:27:27,759
The Hao-Qing ship makes a comeback.

338
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,879
I can't guarantee you'll be popular again,

339
00:27:30,880 --> 00:27:32,839
but I'll cooperate however I need to.

340
00:27:33,240 --> 00:27:34,640
Straightforward. Here.

341
00:27:41,559 --> 00:27:42,680
A work photo.

342
00:27:45,079 --> 00:27:47,480
The major shareholder of
Chunshan Su is Feng Lizhen's niece.

343
00:27:47,720 --> 00:27:49,920
Xu Changyang also has
shares in Chunshan Su.

344
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:53,440
His half-brother, Wenshu,

345
00:27:53,960 --> 00:27:55,920
was the investor for your last movie.

346
00:27:56,839 --> 00:27:58,959
Their shared father, Xu Jinbai,

347
00:27:58,960 --> 00:28:01,440
I don't know how much money
he laundered through this company.

348
00:28:01,480 --> 00:28:02,759
And I can't find out.

349
00:28:03,359 --> 00:28:06,359
But how much sky-high priced
tea was purchased through him?

350
00:28:06,519 --> 00:28:08,759
Anyone who wants to
investigate can definitely find out.

351
00:28:08,920 --> 00:28:10,880
Do you know why Xu Jinbai

352
00:28:11,920 --> 00:28:14,239
would rather let Xu Changyang
bear the title of an illegitimate child

353
00:28:14,240 --> 00:28:15,839
than divorce his first wife?

354
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:17,279
Because he's afraid.

355
00:28:18,160 --> 00:28:20,720
He's afraid these dirty deals
behind the scenes will be exposed.

356
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:23,759
And the internet has
no shortage of sleuths.

357
00:28:24,240 --> 00:28:29,479
I went through a lot of hoops to
get this photo from a focus puller.

358
00:28:29,480 --> 00:28:30,639
It really doesn't prove much.

359
00:28:30,640 --> 00:28:32,720
But the Xu family really
can't stand up to scrutiny.

360
00:28:32,880 --> 00:28:35,639
And the path Xu Changyang wants to take

361
00:28:35,640 --> 00:28:38,120
really can't weather the storms
of the entertainment industry.

362
00:28:39,519 --> 00:28:40,640
Kicking him out

363
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:41,880
is good for everyone.

364
00:28:56,119 --> 00:28:57,880
Today's material is enough for you to use.

365
00:28:58,480 --> 00:29:00,640
Coordinate with my company
regarding the variety show.

366
00:29:15,440 --> 00:29:16,440
What's wrong?

367
00:29:17,640 --> 00:29:18,760
What, what, what's going on?

368
00:29:19,160 --> 00:29:22,519
Mom, my ship has back to life!

369
00:29:22,880 --> 00:29:25,119
I'm so happy, Mom!

370
00:29:25,240 --> 00:29:26,240
Ah, good.

371
00:29:26,279 --> 00:29:28,119
As long as you're happy.

372
00:29:30,480 --> 00:29:31,480
Why are you crying?

373
00:29:34,079 --> 00:29:36,440
That trending topic online
was suppressed a long time ago.

374
00:29:36,519 --> 00:29:39,160
A video with a blocked face
doesn't prove anything either.

375
00:29:40,279 --> 00:29:41,719
The one you just saw in the video,

376
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:43,640
the actor officially
announced a variety show.

377
00:29:44,160 --> 00:29:46,079
It definitely has nothing
to do with the kid.

378
00:29:46,880 --> 00:29:48,160
Ah, okay.

379
00:29:48,559 --> 00:29:49,920
I'll pass it on to the boss.

380
00:29:50,359 --> 00:29:51,559
Thank you for your trouble.

381
00:29:53,559 --> 00:29:54,559
It's fine.

382
00:30:01,240 --> 00:30:02,680
Go warn that person.

383
00:30:02,960 --> 00:30:03,960
Understood.

384
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:26,160
The boss knows you've investigated a lot.

385
00:30:26,920 --> 00:30:27,960
Know when to stop.

386
00:30:28,720 --> 00:30:30,880
You should know what that means.

387
00:30:32,279 --> 00:30:33,279
I do.

388
00:30:49,279 --> 00:30:50,838
Did you find my teapot?

389
00:30:50,839 --> 00:30:51,559
I'll be downstairs in a bit.

390
00:30:51,560 --> 00:30:52,920
Bring it out to me.

391
00:30:53,079 --> 00:30:53,920
Teapots are everywhere.

392
00:30:53,921 --> 00:30:55,759
Just buy one at the airport.

393
00:30:56,079 --> 00:30:58,479
Mind your own business.
I'll be there in five minutes.

394
00:30:58,480 --> 00:30:59,640
Get ready to come downstairs.

395
00:31:39,359 --> 00:31:40,359
Stop the car.

396
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:58,640
My world is a raging storm.

397
00:31:58,720 --> 00:32:00,119
We're not in the same world.

398
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:02,960
Let's go back to square one.

399
00:32:18,839 --> 00:32:20,319
Call Sister Jialin.

400
00:32:21,039 --> 00:32:22,919
The Chunshan Su music
video can't be broadcast.

401
00:32:24,240 --> 00:32:25,240
Terminate the contract.

402
00:32:25,920 --> 00:32:27,160
I'll cover the compensation.

403
00:32:28,640 --> 00:32:30,240
It's my first time seeing you like this.

404
00:32:30,279 --> 00:32:32,039
Like a stray dog caught in the rain.

405
00:32:32,519 --> 00:32:34,119
Why use a dog to describe Changyang?

406
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:35,839
Mom, you don't get it.

407
00:32:35,920 --> 00:32:37,318
Calling him the queen's dog

408
00:32:37,319 --> 00:32:38,319
is a compliment.

409
00:32:38,960 --> 00:32:40,079
Who's the queen?

410
00:32:40,519 --> 00:32:41,519
My brother.

411
00:32:42,240 --> 00:32:43,360
I don't understand you kids.

412
00:32:43,720 --> 00:32:45,920
I say go upstairs
and take a hot shower,

413
00:32:46,160 --> 00:32:47,960
then change into some clean clothes.

414
00:32:48,079 --> 00:32:49,559
You need to respect your own body.

415
00:32:50,759 --> 00:32:54,039
Go, you're dripping
wet and ruining my sofa.

416
00:32:55,079 --> 00:32:56,079
Careful.

417
00:33:05,839 --> 00:33:06,880
What's wrong with them?

418
00:33:08,440 --> 00:33:09,440
Angsty romance.

419
00:33:10,359 --> 00:33:11,439
Explain it to Mom properly.

420
00:33:11,440 --> 00:33:12,758
Mom doesn't understand this internet slang.

421
00:33:12,759 --> 00:33:13,880
Grandma definitely gets it.

422
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:21,160
Yangyang, take your medicine.

423
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:22,480
What do you want to eat?

424
00:33:22,559 --> 00:33:23,679
Auntie will make it for you.

425
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:45,799
Your husband is running
a fever in your bed.

426
00:34:03,880 --> 00:34:06,840
Cut off all trade relations
with Chunshan Su.

427
00:34:08,679 --> 00:34:09,679
Understood.

428
00:34:10,239 --> 00:34:12,399
The music video Qinglang
shot for Chunshan Su earlier...

429
00:34:13,000 --> 00:34:15,120
His company has already
refunded the endorsement fee.

430
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:17,400
Are the accounts clean?

431
00:34:18,159 --> 00:34:19,159
Spotless.

432
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:22,559
Make sure all the footage
is completely scrubbed.

433
00:34:23,599 --> 00:34:26,079
Got it, I'll send someone to handle it.

434
00:34:37,440 --> 00:34:38,599
Pour me a glass of water.

435
00:34:47,880 --> 00:34:49,600
You didn't orchestrate this whole incident,

436
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:51,800
but you definitely catalyzed it.

437
00:34:53,559 --> 00:34:56,000
From the moment you appointed
Qinglang as the ambassador,

438
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:58,199
your pieces were already in motion.

439
00:34:59,280 --> 00:35:00,599
If my guess is correct,

440
00:35:01,599 --> 00:35:02,638
you must have also shown him

441
00:35:02,639 --> 00:35:04,599
the photos Shi Yuhao
took while stalking us.

442
00:35:05,800 --> 00:35:08,256
The fact that Shi Yuhao convinced
him to join the variety show

443
00:35:08,280 --> 00:35:09,920
proves he has more evidence in his hands.

444
00:35:11,159 --> 00:35:13,159
The photo of him and
Shi Yuhao that trended,

445
00:35:14,159 --> 00:35:16,000
he intentionally leaked it to the media.

446
00:35:17,039 --> 00:35:18,679
Terminating the contract with Chunshan Su

447
00:35:18,760 --> 00:35:20,159
proves he's protecting you.

448
00:35:20,400 --> 00:35:21,800
And he's protecting me, too.

449
00:35:25,360 --> 00:35:26,559
See for yourself.

450
00:35:27,599 --> 00:35:30,000
Your application for the
training camp was revoked.

451
00:35:30,993 --> 00:35:34,993
This is a second chance I
pulled strings to get for you.

452
00:35:37,880 --> 00:35:39,800
So you told him about this, too.

453
00:35:40,800 --> 00:35:41,800
Changyang.

454
00:35:42,880 --> 00:35:44,800
Selfishly speaking,

455
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:47,639
you are the child I value the most.

456
00:35:48,880 --> 00:35:51,000
I don't want to suppress
any of your dreams.

457
00:35:51,480 --> 00:35:53,759
Even if it means going
to the Hunter School,

458
00:35:53,760 --> 00:35:55,320
where life and death are unpredictable,

459
00:35:56,159 --> 00:35:58,599
I still want to support
you in achieving your goals.

460
00:36:00,800 --> 00:36:02,800
Unselfishly speaking,

461
00:36:03,559 --> 00:36:07,639
your qualities in many areas far
exceed those of ordinary people.

462
00:36:09,400 --> 00:36:12,760
You can see the big
picture through the details,

463
00:36:13,239 --> 00:36:16,000
and focus on the details
within the big picture.

464
00:36:18,039 --> 00:36:20,000
You shouldn't waste your talent.

465
00:36:21,760 --> 00:36:24,800
And he doesn't want you to waste it either.

466
00:36:28,159 --> 00:36:32,599
This is the last chance you can seize.

467
00:37:15,529 --> 00:37:17,963
[The two couplets on the side talk about the
sensory pleasures of reading and being alone]

468
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:18,880
What's been up with you lately?

469
00:37:18,881 --> 00:37:20,281
You haven't been coming to my room.

470
00:37:23,159 --> 00:37:26,280
The latter half of the
show is pretty stifling.

471
00:37:27,039 --> 00:37:27,880
If you're feeling stifled, come to me.

472
00:37:27,881 --> 00:37:29,521
I guarantee I'll help you let it all out.

473
00:37:34,039 --> 00:37:36,000
I want to stay in character.

474
00:39:37,920 --> 00:39:38,960
So beautiful.

475
00:39:39,159 --> 00:39:40,359
Hey, handsome!

476
00:39:40,360 --> 00:39:41,159
Look over here!
Nice!

477
00:39:42,159 --> 00:39:43,159
Hold up the lantern.

478
00:39:43,186 --> 00:39:47,173
[All the Weibo trending topics
are about BL actors and their shows]

479
00:39:57,920 --> 00:39:58,519
Cut! Next!
Bring the lantern over here.

480
00:39:59,360 --> 00:40:00,159
Let's get a close-up.

481
00:40:00,360 --> 00:40:01,360
Okay.

482
00:40:14,239 --> 00:40:17,039
A little to the left, a bit higher.

483
00:40:19,119 --> 00:40:20,239
Both of you, look over here.

484
00:40:20,280 --> 00:40:21,480
Hey, that's fantastic!

485
00:40:21,679 --> 00:40:23,079
Haojue, stand up.

486
00:40:23,159 --> 00:40:25,079
Yes, right, look at each other.

487
00:40:26,239 --> 00:40:27,239
Wrap!

488
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:29,480
Yeah! Happy wrap!

489
00:40:29,679 --> 00:40:30,679
Happy wrap!

490
00:40:34,920 --> 00:40:36,320
Good, look over here.

491
00:40:36,480 --> 00:40:37,879
Come on, look at me.

492
00:40:37,880 --> 00:40:39,519
So handsome, looking good!

493
00:40:39,639 --> 00:40:40,880
Beautiful, beautiful!
